It seems the ambient package cannot generate 1D-Perlin noise, so we cannot generate say time waveforms based on this idea. p5.js of course can do 1D.



There is also another new package called [opensimplex2] that can generate simplex noise, that is said to be computationally less intense compared to Perlin Noise. We will discuss that in the next section. TBD.
